{"t":"Halls of Hope","s":"halls-of-hope-a947f","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Death_Portal_2b7177.gif","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Halls of Hope</b> is a temple located north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32326,32090,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32326, 32090, 7)</a>. It was implemented in the Winter Update 2016.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Unfinished_state\">Unfinished state</span></h2>\n<p>Initially the temple will be in an unfinished state. By progressing in the <a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a> it can be finished. In this state it will contain: <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUnVpbmVkX0NvbHVtbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Ruined Column (page does not exist)\">Ruined Columns</span>, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT3Zlcmdyb3duX01vbnVtZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Overgrown Monument (page does not exist)\">Overgrown Monuments</span>, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRW1wdHlfV2F0ZXJ3YXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Empty Waterway (page does not exist)\">Empty Waterway</span>, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGxhbnRfVHViP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Plant Tub (page does not exist)\">Plant Tub</span>, <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRW1wdHlfUnVpbmVkX1BsYW50X1R1Yj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Empty Ruined Plant Tub (page does not exist)\">Empty Ruined Plant Tub</span> and an <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing%20Shrine\">Imbuing Shrine</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Finished_state\">Finished state</span></h2>\n<p>When the temple is finished rebuilding, it will contain six coloured portals.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Death Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Portal_2b7177.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Portal\">Death Portal</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Masonry\">Old Masonry</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32805,31657,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32805, 31657, 8)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Lady%20Tenebris\">Lady Tenebris</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Energy Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Portal_0fd710.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Portal\">Energy Portal</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Replica%20Dungeon\">Replica Dungeon</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32786,32818,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32786, 32818, 13)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Lloyd\">Lloyd</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Earth Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Portal_7e49c4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Portal\">Earth Portal</a> leading to near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Desecrated%20Glade\">Desecrated Glade</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32635,32257,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32635, 32257, 7)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Mounted%20Thorn%20Knight\">Mounted Thorn Knight</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Fire Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Portal_d62eb7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Portal\">Fire Portal</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20Complex\">Temple Complex</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33339,31168,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33339, 31168, 7)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20of%20Dragonking%20Zyrtarch\">Soul of Dragonking Zyrtarch</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Ice Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Portal_2702a3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Portal\">Ice Portal</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32206,31027,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32206, 31027, 10)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Melting%20Frozen%20Horror\">Melting Frozen Horror</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Portal\"><img alt=\"Holy Portal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Holy_Portal_f02359.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Portal\">Holy Portal</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Shaper%20Dungeon\">Astral Shaper Dungeon</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32780,32686,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32780, 32686, 14)</a> with boss <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Time%20Guardian\">The Time Guardian</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>Furthermore there is a seventh teleporter, an <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Gate\">Energy Gate</a> leading to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Shaper%20Ruins\">Astral Shaper Boss Dungeon</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32905,32847,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32905, 32847, 13)</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Halls of Hope NPCs (2 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Albinius\">Albinius</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Albinius\"><img alt=\"Albinius\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Albinius_497108.gif\" width=\"70\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Clairvoyant</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Halls of Hope</strong>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ivalisse\">Ivalisse</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ivalisse\"><img alt=\"Ivalisse\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ivalisse_ced15b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Cleric</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Halls of Hope</strong>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["forgotten-knowledge-quest","formorgar-mines-hoist-quest","killing-in-the-name-of-quest","opticording-sphere-quest"]}